WEBVTT

1
00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:50.593
{\an8}BASE SA NOBELA NA "INFLUENZA"
NI HAN SANG-WOON

2
00:01:05.775 --> 00:01:07.942
Corporal Jeon!

3
00:01:07.943 --> 00:01:10.070
Hindi ba dapat may gawin tayo tungkol diyan?

4
00:01:13.741 --> 00:01:14.949
Ibaba mo yan!

5
00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:17.118
Bibigyan tayo ng impiyerno ng admin officer
kung papaso mo yan.

6
00:01:17.119 --> 00:01:19.412
Ngunit kami ay mga sundalo.
May kailangan tayong gawin!

7
00:01:19.413 --> 00:01:20.663
alam ko. Sandali lang.

8
00:01:20.664 --> 00:01:21.915
- Kaya kong barilin ito.
- Hindi mo kaya!

9
00:01:21.916 --> 00:01:23.125
Babarilin ko to!

10
00:01:25.628 --> 00:01:27.462
- Ibaba ang iyong rifle!
- Paano ako?

11
00:01:27.463 --> 00:01:29.422
- May kailangan tayong gawin!
- Huwag magpaputok!

12
00:01:29.423 --> 00:01:30.382
Anong gagawin natin?

13
00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:32.008
Papunta sila dito.

14
00:01:32.009 --> 00:01:33.718
- Papalapit na sila sa amin.
- Nakikita ko iyon!

15
00:01:33.719 --> 00:01:34.719
- In-ho!
- Oo?

16
00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:36.514
- Dumiretso sila sa amin!
- Sir!

17
00:01:52.071 --> 00:01:53.072
Hindi!

18
00:01:53.572 --> 00:01:54.949
Kailangan nilang tumigil!

19
00:02:31.777 --> 00:02:34.320
ano yun? ano ba naman

20
00:02:34.321 --> 00:02:35.906
Pag-atake ba ng terorista?

21
00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:38.032
Ano ba yan?

22
00:02:38.033 --> 00:02:40.285
Paano ang mga tao sa ibaba?

23
00:02:40.286 --> 00:02:41.619
- Damn it.
- Talaga?

24
00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:43.204
- Sir!
- Ito ay isang emergency!

25
00:02:43.205 --> 00:02:44.247
Hey.

26
00:02:44.248 --> 00:02:47.042
Dapat tayong bumalik, tama?
Ito ay isang estado ng kagipitan.

27
00:02:49.044 --> 00:02:51.004
Kung nahaharap tayo sa state of emergency,

28
00:02:51.005 --> 00:02:53.631
